  "description": "NoxGrid: a custom-drawn WinForms grid and spreadsheet component (.NET Framework 4.7.2+, VB.NET and C#). Virtual rendering (1 million rows), unbound, bound and virtual modes, Excel-style formulas (129 functions), Excel and CSV import/export, multiple sheets, filter, sort, merge, cell and conditional formatting, validation, row groups and subtotals, find and replace, undo, print preview, 13 color schemes, Visual Studio designer. Same features and names as the web edition (@novnox/grid).",
